Reading this: the last line of each fold is the filter the mechanism search needs.
A candidate whose first gap is most of its avgR cannot be traded from Thailand,
however good its close-fill number looks. avgR here carries NO control and is
not evidence of edge — only the close-vs-open DIFFERENCE is being read.
